+## 变更范围
+<!-- MACHINE-DRAFT:proposal-scope:60be1ee4b9c63fedd8c12a8a35074c5fde85d03ceb5e280fb91ae5096186b189:begin 机器预填段——整段改写会被 flow done 拒收；确要修改：sillyspec flow amend-draft --change 2026-09-30-docs-gate-zero 留痕重锚 -->
